    "title": "Diboll beauty, 6, named 'Little Miss Angelina County'",
    "text": "Bexley Rose Callison, 6-year-old daughter of Iris and Cole Callison of Diboll, has been awarded the title of “Little Miss Angelina County” and will compete in the America’s Best National Pageant Sept. 11-13 in Nashville, Tennessee.\nShe won the Denim and Diamonds America’s Best Pageant award in Huntsville June 20.",
